# Soft-linked cursor-packs

- Before editing under `.cursor/skills/`, `.cursor/rules/`, or `.cursor/personas/`, MUST check whether the path is a symlink into `.cursor/packs/shared/`.
- If it is pack-linked: MUST follow `.cursor/skills/edit-cursor-packs/SKILL.md` (branch/commit in **cursor-packs**, then bump the consumer submodule). MUST NOT treat the path as a normal consumer-owned file.
- If it is a real file/directory: it is a consumer overlay; edit and commit in the consumer repo.
- New shared skill, rule, or persona names MUST be added to `.cursor/packs/shared/scripts/link-into-project.sh` allow-lists and the link script re-run in consumers.
